Iron Bones is a monk discipline that strengthens the skeletal structure
through specialized conditioning. Years of careful training transforms
the monk's bones from ordinary tissue into hardened material resistant
to fractures and breaks.

This passive skill provides immunity to bone-related conditions
proportional to your skill level. Where others might suffer broken limbs
from powerful blows, a monk with Iron Bones can withstand tremendous
impacts without skeletal damage.

Iron Bones is part of the Iron Body discipline, which includes techniques
for hardening various parts of the monk's body through meditation and
physical conditioning.

Class: Monk
Discipline: Iron Body

